# Steel, revision A

Steel grade and constants, and the IPE sections of
[sections.texl](sections.texl), for the documents that import this
reference. A package imports it by its folder, or by its packed file, as
`~/references/steel-revA.texlz`: the import reads this document.
<% texl.import "sections.texl" ~> (s -> bind "IPE" s.data.IPE) %>
<%
grade = {name: "S355", fy: 355},   # yield strength in N/mm²
E = 210000,                        # modulus of elasticity in N/mm²
gammaM0 = 1.0                      # partial factor for resistance
%>
Grade <% grade.name %>: f<sub>y</sub> = <% grade.fy %> N/mm², E = <% E %> N/mm²,
γ<sub>M0</sub> = <% gammaM0 %>. Sections: <% IPE.IPE240.name %> to
<% IPE.IPE330.name %>.
